      "mergedPostDetails": "Developers:\nIf you update an avatar while the game is open, you can switch to another avatar before it's updated, then switch back to see it reload the new one. \nHowever, if you're wearing the new updated model, THEN go to another world wearing it, the game uses a previous cached version, thereby obscuring the changes.\nFix: Restart the game, or switch to another avatar and switch back again and it'll use the new one once more.",
